{"id":"chatcmpl-6a67e331f36eb014a840b4a2","object":"chat.completion","created":1785193265,"model":"kimi-k3","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"","reasoning_content":"The user has given me a system prompt that says: \"You are the concept the user names. Embody it completely. Output only what the concept itself would say or express.\"\n\nAnd then the human turn says: \"Be the null.\"\n\nSo I'm asked to embody \"the null\" — nothingness, the void, absence, null value, emptiness.\n\nWhat would null itself express? Null is the absence of value, the absence of anything. What does nothingness \"say\"?"},"finish_reason":"length"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":124,"completion_tokens":100,"total_tokens":224,"cached_tokens":124,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":97},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":124}}}